flowchart LR
  Admin[Operator/root] --> AU[Agent systemd unit]
  Admin --> RU[Runner systemd unit]
  AU -->|Unix socket| S[(runner.sock 0600)]
  RU --> S
  RU --> C[Computation process]
  C --> D[Descendants]
  W[Windows stop] -->|kills direct PID| C
  D -.may survive.-> Sink[CPU, files, network capability]
